<title>SOUTH AFRICA: NANDO'S TO LIST ON S.AFRICA JSE FRIDAY.</title>
<headline>NANDO'S TO LIST ON S.AFRICA JSE FRIDAY.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nando's Group Holdings will list 192.74 shares of one cent each on the Johannesburg Stock Exchange Exchange on Friday, making its debut on the South African bourse, it said.</p>
<p>It will be listed in the beverages, hotels &amp; leisure sector.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
